Run the server on the Node this repo builds with.

code-server pins Node 22 in its engines field, which npm enforces on install, so
the assembled tree refuses to build under the toolchain everything else here
uses. A range rather than a single major, and its ceiling is the one .nvmrc
names - `IDE engine patch rejects the old upstream Node major` pins it there, so
a Node bump that forgets this file fails in the checkout instead of in an image
build.

--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -106,3 +106,3 @@
   "engines": {
-    "node": "22"
+    "node": ">=24.15.0 <25"
   },
